Third-party data

The CSV files in demo-app/data/ are derived from synthetic data produced by
the Jaffle Shop Generator ("jafgen"), Copyright dbt Labs, Inc. and
contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Source:  https://github.com/dbt-labs/jaffle-shop-generator
  Version: jafgen 0.4.14 (PyPI)
  Command: uvx --python 3.12 jafgen@0.4.14 3

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by dbt Labs.

Modifications made to the generated data (demo-app/data/prepare.py):
  * kept 10% of orders, selected by md5(order id);
  * kept only order items that belong to kept orders;
  * renamed files (raw_items -> order_items, dropped the "raw_" prefix);
  * dropped raw_supplies and raw_tweets.

All names and records are synthetic. No real customer data is included.
